cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Spatial Random Forests in 3D: SRF, GLS-RF and tree baselines under spatial block cross-validation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a 3D voxel-kernel spatial random forest (SRF_3D)
  and an anisotropic RF-GLS (GLS-RF_3D) for mineral resource estimation,
  together with the spatial block cross-validation design under which they and
  the tree baselines are evaluated, the design ablation, and the hyperparameter
  sensitivity analysis. A synthetic dataset generator is included so the full
  workflow runs without the proprietary case-study data.
